### Player Movement System
```javascript
// Horizontal movement with acceleration/deceleration
const playerPhysics = {
    position: vec2(0, -8),          // Bottom of screen
    velocity: vec2(0, 0),           // Current velocity
    maxSpeed: 6.0,                   // Units per second
    acceleration: 15.0,              // Speed up rate
    deceleration: 25.0,             // Slow down rate

    update(dt) {
        // Apply input force with clamping
        this.velocity.x += input.x * this.acceleration * dt;
        this.velocity.x = clamp(this.velocity.x, -this.maxSpeed, this.maxSpeed);

        // Apply deceleration when no input
        if (Math.abs(input.x) < 0.1) {
            this.velocity.x *= Math.pow(0.95, dt * 60); // Exponential decay
        }

        // Update position with delta time
        this.position.x += this.velocity.x * dt;
    }
};
```

